  "confidence": "high",
  "decision_summary": "The query is donepezil, a well-established CNS drug. Direct evidence from the closest analogue (donepezil N-oxide) and multiple N-benzylpiperidine-containing analogues demonstrates robust brain uptake across rats, mice, and monkeys. The physicochemical prior is favorable for passive diffusion, and the basic amine/efflux liability does not prevent meaningful CNS access.",
